00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:27.120
- Golfers, they love khaki.

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:28.290
Khakis!

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:29.617
It's just khakis.

00:07:29.617 --> 00:07:31.620
And I love khaki. Okay?

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:32.707
- But we're not going
to work in a cubicle.

00:07:32.707 --> 00:07:35.280
- No, it's the same.
It was the same outfit.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:37.680
And I'm like, you know what,
I've always been inspired

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:41.100
by old golf clothing
from like the seventies

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:41.933
and the eighties.

00:07:41.933 --> 00:07:42.900
- The knickers.
- Yeah, the knickers.

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:44.580
Tthe tartans. The plaids.

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:48.660
All of that was always so cool
to me as I grew up thrifting.

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:51.300
And so I would have on
these old golf outfits.

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:53.460
So, you know, fast forward a couple years.

00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:54.930
Here we are starting to
